  "name": "Dividing by 0.5, 0.25, and 0.1",
  "rule": "How many fit in 1? There are 2 halves, 4 quarters, 10 tenths in 1. So ÷0.5 is × 2, ÷0.25 is × 4, ÷0.1 is × 10.",
